<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugo January RPI up 1.4 pct vs 4.4 pct in December.</title>
<headline>Yugo January RPI up 1.4 pct vs 4.4 pct in December.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV INFLATION	  JAN 97     DEC 96    JAN 96</p>
<p> monthly RPI index rise    + 1.4	+ 4.4     + 9.5</p>
<p> yr/yr pct change	    +37.7	+58.7    +108.5</p>
<p>NOTES -- January 1997 RPI was 15.8 percent up against the average in 1996.</p>
<p>The average 1996 RPI was 93.1 percent up against the average for 1995.</p>
<p>Figures refer to the Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 2224305</p>
</text>
